---
import styles from './FounderStory.module.css'
import UserIcon from './icons/UserIcon.astro'
---

<section class={styles.founderStory} aria-labelledby='story-heading'>
  <div class={styles.storyWrapper}>
    <div class={styles.storyContainer}>
      <div class={styles.storyImage}>
        <img
          src='/logos-and-images/Business Photo.JPG'
          alt='Jennifer, founder of JMJ Financial Coaching'
          width='400'
          height='400'
          loading='lazy'
        />
      </div>
      <div class={styles.storyRightContent}>
        <div class={styles.storyHeader}>
          <div class={styles.headerIconWrapper}>
            <UserIcon width='64' height='64' class={styles.headerSectionIcon} />
          </div>
          <h2 id='story-heading' class={styles.storyHeaderH2}>My Story</h2>
        </div>
        <div class={styles.storyText}>
          <p>
            Three years ago, I suddenly lost my job and our household income was cut in half overnight. We were really
            scared. But putting together a budget changed everything. We made some lifestyle changes, and I got to
            achieve our dream of me being a stay at home mom.
          </p>
          <p>
            That experience of fear and then finding peace through taking control of our money is why I became a
            financial coach. I want to help you find that same peace and reach your goals, just like we did.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
